    {
        "content": "<p>2 messages were moved here from <a href=\"#narrow/channel/270676-lean4/topic/Some.20grind.20suggestions.20result.20in.20.60try.20sorry.60\">#lean4 &gt; Some grind suggestions result in &#96;try sorry&#96;</a> by <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"310045\">Eric Wieser</span>.</p>",
